Audit complete: **FAIL / NOT_LEGIT**.

Fresh builds and all 11 claims reached `#Top`, but:

- The submitted program mishandles empty fields, e.g. `""` returns `[1]` instead of `[]`.
- The spec proves only four fixed inputs and isolated loop transitions—no universal entry-point postcondition.

Detailed findings: [REVIEW.md](/audit-output/REVIEW.md)  
Supporting artifacts: [rule inventory](/audit-output/evidence/05_rule_inventory.md) and [differential log](/audit-output/evidence/02_differential.log).
